# Keys read from configuration during the recorded run. Regenerate with -update.
# One line per key, sorted, so adding a reader shows as one added line.
#
# Recorded by wrapping the source the run is given, because a key reaches a reader
# through a string built at the call site and cannot be found by reading the tree.
# How many times each key was read is left out: that moves with refactoring, where
# this set moves only when a reader is added or removed.

